```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Button Collection</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Instrument+Serif&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0a;
      --surface: #141414;
      --cream: #f5f0e8;
      --ochre: #d4a853;
      --rust: #c45c3c;
      --sage: #7a9a7e;
      --slate: #6b7280;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 3rem;
      background: var(--bg);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: var(--cream);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease forwards;
    }

    .button-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .btn-wrapper {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease forwards;
    }

    .btn-wrapper:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    .btn-wrapper:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
    .btn-wrapper:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    .btn-wrapper:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
    .btn-wrapper:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
    .btn-wrapper:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

    .label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--slate);
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* ============================================
       1. REFINED — Understated elegance
       ============================================ */
    .btn-refined {
      position: relative;
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.3);
      color: var(--cream);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      cursor: pointer;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: border-color 0.4s ease, color 0.4s ease;
    }

    .btn-refined::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: var(--cream);
      transform: scaleX(0);
      transform-origin: left;
      transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .btn-refined:hover {
      border-color: var(--cream);
      color: var(--bg);
    }

    .btn-refined:hover::before {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }

    /* ============================================
       2. TERRACOTTA — Warm & earthy
       ============================================ */
    .btn-terracotta {
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      background: var(--rust);
      border: none;
      color: var(--cream);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      cursor: pointer;
      position: relative;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn-terracotta::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 0 var(--cream);
      transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn-terracotta:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(196, 92, 60, 0.4);
    }

    .btn-terracotta:hover::after {
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--cream);
    }

    /* ============================================
       3. LINK — Minimal with arrow
       ============================================ */
    .btn-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: var(--ochre);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .btn-link .arrow {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 24px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--ochre);
      position: relative;
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn-link .arrow::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      top: 50%;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--ochre);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--ochre);
      transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);
    }

    .btn-link:hover .arrow {
      width: 40px;
    }

    /* ============================================
       4. GHOST — Subtle glass effect
       ============================================ */
    .btn-ghost {
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      background: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.05);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.1);
      color: var(--cream);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-ghost:hover {
      background: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.1);
      border-color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.3);
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }

    /* ============================================
       5. OCHRE — Bold accent
       ============================================ */
    .btn-ochre {
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      background: var(--ochre);
      border: none;
      color: var(--bg);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      cursor: pointer;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: letter-spacing 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn-ochre::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      width: 0;
      height: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      transition: width 0.5s ease, height 0.5s ease;
    }

    .btn-ochre:hover {
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    }

    .btn-ochre:hover::before {
      width: 300px;
      height: 300px;
    }

    /* ============================================
       6. MONO — Brutalist stamp
       ============================================ */
    .btn-brutal {
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      background: var(--cream);
      border: 3px solid var(--cream);
      color: var(--bg);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ochre);
    }

    .btn-brutal:hover {
      transform: translate(2px, 2px);
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ochre);
    }

    .btn-brutal:active {
      transform: translate(4px, 4px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--ochre);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Button Collection</h1>

  <div class="button-grid">
    <div class="btn-wrapper">
      <button class="btn-refined">Explore</button>
      <span class="label">Refined</span>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-wrapper">
      <button class="btn-terracotta">Get Started</button>
      <span class="label">Terracotta</span>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-wrapper">
      <button class="btn-link">
        Continue Reading
        <span class="arrow"></span>
      </button>
      <span class="label">Link</span>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-wrapper">
      <button class="btn-ghost">Learn More</button>
      <span class="label">Ghost</span>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-wrapper">
      <button class="btn-ochre">Subscribe</button>
      <span class="label">Ochre</span>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-wrapper">
      <button class="btn-brutal">Buy Now</button>
      <span class="label">Brutal</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
```

Six distinct styles:

| Style | Mood |
|-------|------|
| **Refined** | Minimal fill-sweep, elegant hover |
| **Terracotta** | Warm, earthy with lift shadow |
| **Link** | Arrow that extends on hover |
| **Ghost** | Frosted glass, subtle |
| **Ochre** | Bold accent with spreading ripple |
| **Brutal** | Offset shadow stamp, tactile press |

